# Studentkare AI Pair Programming & Coding Rules

## Core Guidelines
- Strictly adhere to [CODING_STANDARDS.md](CODING_STANDARDS.md) and [ARCHITECTURE.md](ARCHITECTURE.md).
- Frontend: React 18, Vite, TypeScript, Vanilla CSS (Impilo Pearl design tokens in `src/theme/workflows.css`).
- Backend: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy ORM, Pydantic V2.
- Always run `npm run build` and `PYTHONPATH=backend pytest` to verify changes before declaring victory.
- Dev OTP Code is always `123456` across student, admin, and vendor demo accounts in development mode.
- Maintain human-in-the-loop (HITL) safety gates for all clinical AI recommendations.
